-- A sample of the night sky for caelundas-web's tests and its seeded build,
-- in the tables the second migration creates: the twelve zodiac
-- constellations, Ursa Major, Ursa Minor, Orion and Cassiopeia with their
-- figures, and the stars those figures join or brighter than magnitude 3. A
-- `night-sky` run writes the whole catalog and all 88 constellations instead.
--
-- Stars: HYG database v4.1 (https://github.com/astronexus/HYG-Database),
-- CC BY-SA 4.0, David Nash and the HYG contributors; these rows are a derived
-- work under the same license. Constellations and figures: d3-celestial
-- (https://github.com/ofrohn/d3-celestial), BSD-3-Clause, Olaf Frohn.



